Their mental contemplation and their false prestige are like obstacles in the pure devotion of God. Of God,
The pure devotee engaged in service should not be criticized, but the devotee whose devotion is mixed with material qualities
should be improved so that he can rise to the level of pure devotion. Uneducated people
should not be misled by the mixed devotion of those who are not engaged in Bhakti Yoga. But,
those who cannot fully engage in Krishna consciousness should not abandon their assigned tasks by saying that they are illusory. For example, a person who is unable to fully engage in pure Krishna consciousness,
should not abandon their family, considering it a delusion, because doing so will
lead them to immoral sexual life. Therefore, until one attains the state of directly practicing Krishna consciousness,
they should practice physical purification and the analytical knowledge of the material world.
One should engage in this practice. Purity and impurity are the same in all things.
For the sake of investigating the substance, the merits and demerits, auspicious and inauspicious. For dharma, for worldly affairs, for pilgrimage, and so on, O humble one. 3). Meaning of words

